<title>PHILIPPINES: Solid Group Q1 net 158 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Solid Group Q1 net 158 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Solid Group Inc said on Thursday it posted a 158 million peso net income for the first three months of 1997 against 114 million pesos registered in the same period last year.</p>
</text>
